    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκρᾰτ-ιαστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκράτιον, ἡ π. τέχνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					272a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.150
				</span></i>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>skilled in the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκράτιον, ὁ θλίβειν καὶ κατέχειν
